<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15373" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτρον</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], τό, </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρόω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>plough,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				18.374
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηκτὸν ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					10.353
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thgn.
				1201
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.224
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰλλομένων ἀρότρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					340
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρότρῳ ἀναρρηγνύντες αὔλακας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.14
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				515
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Mosch.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				4.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ἀπ᾽ ἀρότρου πληγή,</span> in boxing,
				<i>right-handed</i> blow, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				6.10.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Gym.</u>
				20
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
			metaph. of the <i>organs of generation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				12.46
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄροτρα: γῆ, χώρα, πλέθρα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
